      "body": "## What happens?\r\n快速点击Tab导致出现一个Iframe浮层，整个body都被盖住，无法触发任何操作。\r\n\r\n## Mini Showcase Repository(REQUIRED)\r\n原仓库-master分支\r\n\r\n## How To Reproduce\r\nmaster分支直接运行\r\n- npm run examples:install\r\n- npm run examples:start\r\n- 打开主应用，快速点击/切换左侧tab\r\n- 复现该BUG，出现iframe浮层，所有点击无法触发\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/15866249/203882010-9c600d30-080d-4d43-a8ae-15b88c8287c8.png)\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/15866249/203882036-901b2c1b-1f03-40e2-83aa-b0ab51ac1911.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Context\r\n\r\n- **qiankun Version**: 2.8.4\r\n- **Platform Version**: Windows11'64bit\r\n- **Browser Version**: Chrome 107.0.5304.108\r\n",
